WEBVTT

00:25:29.746 --> 00:25:34.496
it was to make sure that we made it more
likely that anybody had more of

00:25:34.496 --> 00:25:38.246
a chance of doing it. Somehow they
managed to convince us that,

00:25:38.246 --> 00:25:41.454
like we could do anything and
also explain to us that

00:25:41.746 --> 00:25:44.538
the world was organized so
that not everybody could

00:25:44.829 --> 00:25:47.871
and that we it was our responsibility
to make sure that everybody could.

00:25:48.496 --> 00:25:51.829
And that's not a cultural artifact,
but it's the thing that for me,

00:25:51.996 --> 00:25:54.913
I'm most thankful for and
it's the thing that

00:25:54.913 --> 00:26:00.704
I hope I'm able to incorporate from a
values perspective and all of my work